@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
title Resumefolio | Adaptive elicitation roadmap
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1C3453
 BorderColor #9FB2CD
 FontColor #F1F5F9
 DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
 DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
 StartColor #F1F5F9
 EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Review accepted scope, actors, sources and actual extracts;
repeat
 :Select one coherent goal and genuine information gap;
 :Choose technique and prepare questions / evidence plan;
 if (Required material, access and participation available?) then (yes)
  :Conduct the bounded activity;
  :Record actual date, sources, raw evidence and limitations;
  :Separate interpretation and record actual feedback / pending review;
  :Hand reviewed needs and explicit gaps to analysis; <<#173B34>>
 else (not yet)
  :Keep activity planned; record blocker and next action; <<#49351C>>
  :Keep dependent commitment unresolved;
 endif
 :Update remaining questions, owner and dependent gates;
repeat while (Another ready gap needs elicitation now?) is (yes) not (no)
:Retain plan and actual activity records in their separate homes;
stop
legend bottom
Undated sequence; no session duration, automatic schedule or participant commitment implied.
Use LOG-001 / EXT-001–EXT-003 as actual starting evidence, not as completed interviews.
Elicitation handoff does not establish requirement acceptance or technical feasibility.
endlegend
@enduml
